return {
    ["\n　　今天画了一幅画，同学说很好看，我也觉得很好看。\n　　但是父亲说这很丑，他需要我种出好看的白菜，南瓜，去市场上卖个好价钱。\n　　我说好看的画，在画廊也能卖出好价钱。他说菜市场没有门，我们能走过去。画廊的门，我们可推不开。\n　　“永暗的蜡烛，不毁的身躯”，<Letter_RedBig>我觉得这个时代很坏，我不想在这个时代浪费时间了。</>"] = "\n　　Drew a picture today, my classmate said it was very beautiful, and I also think it is very beautiful.\n　　But Father said it was ugly, he needs me to grow good-looking cabbage and pumpkins to sell for a good price at the market.\n　　I said beautiful paintings can also sell for a good price in galleries. He said the vegetable market has no doors, and we can walk over. We can't push open the doors of the gallery.\n　　\"Candle of Eternal Darkness, Indestructible Body\", <Letter_RedBig>I think this era is very bad, I don't want to waste time in this era anymore.</>",
    ["\n　　这一年的最后一天，森林遭遇了百年未遇的暴雪，猫头鹰长老召集起了一场紧急会议。\n\n　　 “北边山洞上方的积雪发生了崩塌，那里面还住着冬眠的蝙蝠一家，我们不能放着它们不管。”\n\n　　所有的动物都沉默了，它们基本不和蝙蝠来往，只有邓恩在去年春天去过那个洞穴，但它早就忘记里面什么样了。\n\n　　“我们去吧！”戴莉跳到了鹿角顶端，“就算你在里面迷失了方向，我的歌声也能把我们带到正确的道路上。”\n\n　　它们就这样进入了洞穴，里面结构错综复杂，邓恩和戴莉费了不少力气才找到受伤的蝙蝠一家。就在它们准备离开洞穴的时候，外面狂风大作，无数雪花被风裹挟而来，挡住了所有的光。邓恩又尝试了几个方向，比找不到出口更令人绝望的是蝙蝠一家越来越微弱的呼吸。\n\n　　戴莉飞到了它耳边开始歌唱，金色的旋律指引抚平了邓恩有些焦躁的心情，他沿着音符亮起的方向走去。十米，五十米，一百米……眼前仍然没有出现洞口的光亮，戴莉意识到前往出口的代价可能比想象中更多。\n\n　　没有犹豫。\n\n　　它飞得更高了，飞到邓恩根本看不清的地方，歌唱到背上的羽毛所剩无几，她开始下坠。\n\n　　眼前还是没有出现光亮。"] = "\n	On the last day of this year, the forest encountered a blizzard unseen in a hundred years, and the owl elder convened an emergency meeting.\n\n	 \"The snow above the cave in the north has collapsed, and a family of hibernating bats still lives inside. We cannot just leave them alone.\"\n\n	All the animals were silent; they basically didn't associate with bats. Only Dunn had been to that cave last spring, but he had long forgotten what it looked like inside.\n\n	\"Let's go!\" Daly jumped to the top of the antlers, \"Even if you lose your way inside, my singing can lead us to the right path.\"\n\n	They entered the cave just like that. The structure inside was intricate, and it took Dunn and Daly quite a bit of effort to find the injured bat family. Just as they were preparing to leave the cave, a violent storm raged outside, and countless snowflakes were carried by the wind, blocking all light. Dunn tried a few more directions, and what was more desperate than not finding the exit was the increasingly weak breathing of the bat family.\n\n	Daly flew to his ear and began to sing. The golden melody guided and smoothed out Dunn's somewhat restless mood, and he walked along the direction where the notes lit up. Ten meters, fifty meters, one hundred meters... there was still no light from the cave entrance in sight. Daly realized that the cost of reaching the exit might be more than imagined.\n\n	Without hesitation.\n\n	It flew higher, flying to a place where Dunn couldn't see clearly at all, singing until there were few feathers left on its back, and she began to fall.\n\n	There was still no light in sight.",
    ["\n寻找通体褐色，遍布花纹，背部有花瓣形斑纹的狸花猫“毛球”\n\n如有线索，请送至<Mark id=\"#159\">豪尔斯街35号</>\n\n线索酬金：<Letter_Highlight_HW>1金镑</>\n寻回酬金：<Letter_Highlight_HW>10金镑</>"] = "\nLooking for a brown, patterned tabby cat named 'Furball' with petal-shaped markings on its back\n\nIf you have any clues, please send them to <Mark id=\"#159\">35 Howls Street</>\n\nClue Reward: <Letter_Highlight_HW>1 Pound</>\nRecovery Reward: <Letter_Highlight_HW>10 Pounds</>",
    ["\n寻猫：米莎\n灰色条纹，四脚雪白，左耳有一小缺口。性格胆小。于佐特兰街附近走失。若有线索，请联络磨坊街17号布兰登家，有重金酬谢。\n\n<Letter_Highlight_HW>重金？有多重？（我开玩笑的！）</>\n<Letter_Highlight_HW>说真的，去问问这附近有个什么能找东西的公司。他们上次帮我找回了钥匙，快得邪门。就说是奥利安娜太太的朋友介绍的，没准儿给你折扣。</>"] = "\nLost Cat: Misha\nGray stripes, four white paws, small notch in the left ear. Timid personality. Lost near Zoutland Street. If you have any clues, please contact the Brandon family at 17 Mill Street. A generous reward is offered.\n\n<Letter_Highlight_HW>Generous reward? How generous? (I'm joking!)</>\n<Letter_Highlight_HW>Seriously, go ask around for some company nearby that can find things. They helped me find my keys last time, it was freakishly fast. Just say you were referred by Mrs. Orianna's friend, maybe they'll give you a discount.</>",
