    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>幽绿织缎・青藤蔓生・精工礼服\n毒藤缠绕着沉默，暗绿深处藏着致命的优雅。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Dark Green Satin · Green Vine Overgrowth · Precision Gown\nPoison ivy entwines with silence, hiding a deadly elegance within the deep dark green.",
